    "raw": "It soon became clear that injecting Drysap into living Florans prompted exceptional results. The sap quickly reproduces within Floran veins, replacing their own with a stronger, hardier substance that leaves the Floran body requiring almost no water. To an extent, this is a miracle serum.",
    "value": "情况很快明朗：将干树汁注射入活的叶族人体内，会引发非凡的效果。此树液能在叶族人的脉络内迅速增殖，以其自身替代原有组织，形成一种更强韧、更坚硬的物质，使得叶族人的身体几乎不再需要水分。在某种程度上，这堪称一种奇迹血清。"
